WEBVTT

00:00.033 --> 00:29.968
Encounter of the Couple Who Share a Past

00:00.533 --> 00:01.953
An Encounter of love and missed opportunities.

00:02.407 --> 00:06.419
Lost memories reunite the couple
who once lost each other.

00:06.687 --> 00:10.207
I can't remember my name or anything.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.727
She has amnesia.

00:11.913 --> 00:15.298
I'll take care of you until you
get your memory back.

00:16.945 --> 00:18.427
Where am I?

00:18.773 --> 00:19.633
Come back!

00:19.700 --> 00:21.353
Are you still with Sachi-san?

00:21.540 --> 00:23.554
A man changes in five years.

00:23.687 --> 00:25.754
"Sachi," like happiness.

00:26.293 --> 00:29.853
Black Jack, Today's Karte - Encounter of the Couple Who Share a Past.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
I'm going to fly to where you are.

00:29.995 --> 00:36.618
kimi no moto e tonde yuku yo

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
I know I can spread my wings when I want to see you.

00:36.953 --> 00:43.959
aitai toki tsubasa hiraku

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
Nobody knows

00:44.544 --> 00:47.629
dara nimo wakaranai

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
when a miracle might occur,

00:48.048 --> 00:51.467
kiseki wa itsu okiru?

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
but it feels like my wish is finally coming true.

00:51.468 --> 00:57.890
nozomi wa kanaeraresou de

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
Because there's only one place I want to go,

00:57.891 --> 01:04.688
mukau basho wa hitotsu shika nai kara

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
iro asenai omoi yosete

01:04.689 --> 01:07.941
I gather my feelings whose colors never fade,

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
and now it seems I'm dreaming.

01:07.942 --> 01:11.487
saa Dreaming now

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
I'm living for your sake?

01:12.072 --> 01:15.407
kimi no tame ni iketeru

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
I will be your strength,

01:15.408 --> 01:18.577
donna chikara nimo naru

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
no matter how far apart we are.

01:18.870 --> 01:21.789
Far away Far away harukana

01:21.790 --> 01:25.584
So Freedom. So Freedom.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
I will send you

01:25.710 --> 01:29.171
kimi no tame no okurou

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
the beautiful blossom of this flower.

01:29.172 --> 01:32.424
kirei ni saita hana wo

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
So let's look for shooting stars.

01:32.592 --> 01:35.511
Shooting Star Shooting Star sagasou

01:35.512 --> 01:39.515
So Freedom. So Freedom.

02:18.012 --> 02:19.012
Crap! Keep driving!

02:27.313 --> 02:28.856
Walk, Largo!

02:32.443 --> 02:34.914
Hey! Largo! Stop!

02:39.159 --> 02:40.993
What happened to her?

02:40.994 --> 02:42.796
She was lying in the road.

02:42.996 --> 02:44.195
Shes badly hurt.

02:44.497 --> 02:45.956
Is there a hospital nearby?

02:45.957 --> 02:47.515
Aye, there is!

02:49.919 --> 02:53.032
Originally "Accident” by Tezuka Osamu

02:49.919 --> 02:53.032
Encounter of the Couple Who Share a Past

02:55.727 --> 02:56.927
Four fractures,

02:57.093 --> 02:58.367
eight internal hemorrhages,

02:58.840 --> 02:59.864
and a concussion too.

03:00.075 --> 03:02.014
Can you save her, Doctor?

03:02.348 --> 03:04.141
Pinoco, We'll start the operation now.

03:04.142 --> 03:04.983
OK!

03:16.203 --> 03:16.730
Scalpel.

03:17.906 --> 03:18.416
Here.

03:21.743 --> 03:23.434
There's an internal hemorrhage under here.

03:25.121 --> 03:27.080
It's a Meckel's diverticulum.

03:27.171 --> 03:28.684
It should be removed,
but I can't right now.

03:29.667 --> 03:31.228
We'll use a temporary treatment.

03:31.461 --> 03:32.502
Pinoco, give me the centesis needle.

03:32.503 --> 03:33.337
Here.

03:38.509 --> 03:39.794
Operation complete.

03:44.940 --> 03:46.635
How is she, Doctor?

03:46.976 --> 03:48.060
The operation went well.

03:48.061 --> 03:49.603
Perfectly!

03:52.398 --> 03:56.085
Repairing so many injuries... You're amazing!

03:57.070 --> 03:59.363
There's still one thing that concerns me.

03:59.364 --> 04:00.697
She has a Meckel's diverticulum.

04:00.698 --> 04:01.782
Meckel?

04:01.783 --> 04:05.153
It's a disorder where a part of the
intestine swells up and bleeds.

04:05.745 --> 04:07.663
We can leave it there for now,

04:08.122 --> 04:11.792
but we should extract it if she starts to feel pain.

04:12.502 --> 04:14.731
And why are you telling me?

04:14.963 --> 04:16.171
Good point.

04:17.465 --> 04:19.633
Shoot, I need to get back to work.

04:21.844 --> 04:23.762
Oh, that reminds me.

04:23.763 --> 04:26.143
Here, it's a good luck charm I carry.

04:26.391 --> 04:27.808
So she'll get well soon.

04:28.977 --> 04:31.895
I'll leave it a near her bed.

04:32.100 --> 04:34.231
I'll stop by again after work.

04:34.232 --> 04:34.861
OK.

04:45.827 --> 04:46.775
Come in.

04:56.379 --> 04:57.546
You're awake?

04:58.381 --> 05:00.007
I'll go get Doc.

05:00.800 --> 05:03.079
My name is Tachibana Toru.

05:03.720 --> 05:06.012
I drove by and found you lying in the road.

05:07.015 --> 05:10.477
You were injured, but the doctor here treated you.

05:11.728 --> 05:13.270
What's your name?

05:13.771 --> 05:15.693
My name?

05:16.357 --> 05:18.358
We need to call your family.

05:19.360 --> 05:21.028
Good, you're awake.

05:21.738 --> 05:22.897
I don't know...

05:23.323 --> 05:28.695
I can't remember my name or anything.

05:30.743 --> 05:32.873
Ohmigewdness!

05:33.291 --> 05:34.541
She has amnesia.

05:34.648 --> 05:36.168
That's troublesome.

05:36.753 --> 05:39.212
If we can't locate her family,

05:39.756 --> 05:42.799
who'll be paying the fees for the surgery and stay?

05:46.397 --> 05:50.390
Her belongings haven't been recovered,
and she has no clues on her.

05:50.391 --> 05:52.809
So you haven't identified who she is?

05:52.810 --> 05:54.284
Unfortunately.

05:54.411 --> 05:58.104
Police Station

05:54.896 --> 05:56.355
Oh, man...

05:56.356 --> 05:58.104
But I can't ignore her.

05:59.108 --> 06:00.901
Take your time.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.520
Toru-san.

06:04.911 --> 06:07.032
I thought you might need some stuff.

06:08.368 --> 06:09.910
Did you remember anything?

06:11.120 --> 06:14.373
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

06:14.649 --> 06:16.541
It's no trouble at all!

06:17.251 --> 06:19.669
I feel lonely, so...

06:20.350 --> 06:21.350
Don't worry.

06:21.381 --> 06:22.923
I'm sure you'll remember someday.

06:23.341 --> 06:28.512
You know what, I'll take care of you until you remember.

06:31.182 --> 06:32.682
So don't worry about a thing.

06:32.683 --> 06:34.726
Leave it all to me!

06:53.545 --> 06:54.515
Here we are.

06:54.539 --> 06:55.705
It's not a pretty place.

07:00.002 --> 07:03.713
I'll be staying at the office, so use this place as you like.

07:03.912 --> 07:05.715
But that's...

07:05.716 --> 07:07.215
Don't worry about it.

07:09.846 --> 07:11.596
Buy anything you need with this.

07:11.597 --> 07:13.339
I'll stop by again after work.

07:17.937 --> 07:20.063
<i>I have such a pretty girl at my place.</i>

07:20.440 --> 07:24.526
All right! I'll pay off her doctor fees in no time!

07:24.527 --> 07:27.154
Hey, can someone make a run to Port Town?

07:27.448 --> 07:29.156
I'll go!

07:29.157 --> 07:31.199
Enthusiastic, aren't we?

07:32.410 --> 07:36.079
Send all after-hour and holiday deliveries my way too!

07:41.419 --> 07:43.712
It's so clean, it's nothing like my room.

07:44.130 --> 07:45.286
I had nothing else to do.

07:45.756 --> 07:49.060
I did the laundry and cooked dinner too.

07:52.722 --> 07:54.264
It's so good!

07:54.265 --> 07:56.446
Nothing beats home cooking!

07:56.869 --> 07:58.189
Is your mother far from here?

07:58.802 --> 07:59.629
I don't have one.

08:00.049 --> 08:01.597
Both of my parents died already.

08:03.025 --> 08:04.025
I'm sorry.

08:04.650 --> 08:05.864
Don't worry about it.

08:06.819 --> 08:09.237
You must have parents.

08:10.031 --> 08:11.198
I don't know...

08:11.378 --> 08:13.116
I'm sure you do!

08:13.701 --> 08:15.350
Anyway, I'll get going.

08:15.703 --> 08:16.620
Thanks for dinner.

08:19.290 --> 08:21.303
I'll have dinner ready again tomorrow.

08:27.715 --> 08:30.550
Toru, it's payday, so let's go out after work.

08:30.905 --> 08:32.802
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

08:32.803 --> 08:34.623
You haven't hung out with us lately.

08:42.063 --> 08:44.726
I thought it might look good on you.

08:51.822 --> 08:53.156
Toru-san...

08:53.783 --> 08:56.159
Why are you so kind to me?

08:56.577 --> 09:00.622
W-Well, b-because...

09:14.887 --> 09:17.767
Can I give you a name?

09:18.641 --> 09:19.391
Yes.

09:20.101 --> 09:21.002
What is it?

09:22.072 --> 09:22.850
Sachi.

09:24.272 --> 09:26.815
"Sachi," like happiness.

09:27.525 --> 09:28.607
Sachi.

09:34.949 --> 09:36.324
Here's the doctor's fee.

09:37.285 --> 09:40.563
Sachi, let's go visit the doctor tomorrow.

09:40.830 --> 09:42.083
Toru, but...

09:42.331 --> 09:43.582
Don't worry about it!

09:43.583 --> 09:45.959
But hey, I'm starving.

09:51.299 --> 09:52.318
Does it hurt?

09:52.842 --> 09:54.259
It's not serious.

10:01.700 --> 10:02.430
Thanks.

10:03.144 --> 10:07.841
Doctor, can you treat her Meckel's diverticulum next?

10:08.316 --> 10:10.609
I think she's been feeling a lot of pain recently.

10:10.610 --> 10:14.740
I can, but I'll ask for my regular price this time.

10:16.029 --> 10:17.029
It's ¥10,000,000.

10:17.450 --> 10:18.731
¥10,000,000?!

10:18.993 --> 10:20.853
Toru, that's so much.

10:21.917 --> 10:22.711
It's OK.

10:23.289 --> 10:25.040
Can you take a look at this, Doctor?

10:26.334 --> 10:30.357
I really want you to treat her, so I came with a contract.

10:30.868 --> 10:35.134
I don't have the money yet,
but will you treat her when I do?

10:35.134 --> 10:36.457
Please?

10:36.802 --> 10:38.595
Do you really need this?

10:38.596 --> 10:41.318
Just in case you get amnesia, Doctor.

10:52.318 --> 10:54.168
It's a promise, Doctor.

10:54.528 --> 10:56.863
I'll really come back with the money.

11:08.403 --> 11:12.473
I think I've never felt so peaceful before.

11:12.672 --> 11:13.526
Me too.

11:14.006 --> 11:16.341
But I sometimes get scared

11:16.342 --> 11:19.427
that you might get your memory back,
and disappear from my life.

11:20.971 --> 11:22.222
That won't happen.

11:22.556 --> 11:27.560
Even if my memories come back,
I know my love for you won't change.

11:28.479 --> 11:29.701
Really?

11:30.106 --> 11:33.650
Then will you stay with me forever?

11:46.643 --> 11:48.534
The savings are growing so much.

11:48.958 --> 11:50.600
Don't push yourself too hard.

11:51.293 --> 11:52.982
Don't worry about a thing.

11:54.672 --> 11:57.090
It's the anniversary of the day we first met.

11:57.091 --> 11:58.595
Let's celebrate tonight.

11:58.788 --> 12:00.088
I'll have a big dinner ready.

12:27.079 --> 12:28.716
Where am I?

12:29.665 --> 12:32.292
What am I doing here?

12:33.627 --> 12:34.648
I'm scared.

12:34.962 --> 12:36.463
Why am I here?

12:37.214 --> 12:39.301
I better go home.

12:45.473 --> 12:46.524
Where to?

12:48.851 --> 12:50.018
Are you all right?

12:50.019 --> 12:51.723
Y-Yeah...

12:52.313 --> 12:54.331
Can you tell me where we are?

12:54.568 --> 12:54.909
Huh?

12:55.990 --> 12:56.697
Never mind.

12:57.356 --> 12:58.356
Go please.

12:58.743 --> 12:59.443
I'm going to...

13:14.335 --> 13:17.003
Hey Sachi, I brought home a bottle of wine.

13:18.172 --> 13:19.468
Has she gone shopping?

13:23.886 --> 13:25.011
Did she...

13:26.514 --> 13:28.515
Sachi! Sachi!

13:28.667 --> 13:29.474
Sachi!

13:36.774 --> 13:40.860
Maybe she'll be home now.

13:45.157 --> 13:46.324
She's gone.

13:46.325 --> 13:47.826
You disappeared so suddenly!

13:47.827 --> 13:50.228
Sachi! Come back!

13:50.680 --> 13:52.410
Please...

13:58.963 --> 14:02.140
You're drinking a lot, lad.

14:02.466 --> 14:04.492
Did your girlfriend run off on you?

14:04.802 --> 14:05.969
None of your business.

14:06.679 --> 14:08.712
Whoa, that was it?

14:08.973 --> 14:12.058
Then wanna go have fun and get your mind off of her?

14:20.985 --> 14:23.012
You're good at this.

14:23.612 --> 14:26.231
I'll bet the whole thing this time.

14:42.464 --> 14:44.090
Never come back again.

14:44.136 --> 14:44.576
Got it?

14:50.055 --> 14:50.969
You're...

14:55.811 --> 14:59.647
He tried to accuse me of something,
so I taught him a lesson.

14:59.910 --> 15:04.068
Once an honest truck driver, now a bouncer
at an underground casino, huh?

15:04.323 --> 15:05.894
You've changed so much.

15:07.823 --> 15:09.991
A man changes in five years.

15:11.160 --> 15:12.742
What happened to Sachi-san?

15:13.537 --> 15:15.854
Her memories came back and
she disappeared from my life.

15:16.540 --> 15:19.667
My life's been going wrong ever since.

15:21.587 --> 15:25.089
There's something I've been wanting to give you.

15:34.850 --> 15:35.975
What's this?

15:36.936 --> 15:39.775
Is that the contract and the surgical fee?

15:40.105 --> 15:43.028
What kind of idiot am I, keeping these for
the woman who disappeared on me?

15:43.981 --> 15:47.030
But Doctor, keep these for me.

15:47.947 --> 15:52.784
And, if you happen to run into her, operate on her.

15:53.953 --> 15:55.641
All this money is clean.

15:55.829 --> 15:57.789
I worked my ass off to earn this.

15:58.499 --> 16:00.432
Do you still think about Sachi-san?

16:00.751 --> 16:02.627
It happened so long ago.

16:02.628 --> 16:03.553
I don't.

16:05.381 --> 16:06.575
Run for it!

16:06.882 --> 16:07.987
Doctor, you better get out.

16:08.175 --> 16:09.384
It's the police.

16:09.385 --> 16:10.104
This way!

16:17.685 --> 16:22.383
Operation of an illegal casino and infliction
of bodily injury have been reported.

16:22.856 --> 16:24.198
Do you admit to all charges?

16:28.130 --> 16:30.959
The judge is young, but very strict.

16:31.198 --> 16:32.782
Be careful with your attitude.

16:34.086 --> 16:35.232
All rise!

16:41.875 --> 16:45.586
Defendant Tachibana Toru, step up to the witness stand.

16:45.876 --> 16:47.380
Y-You're...

16:48.090 --> 16:51.300
Defendant, comply with my order.

16:54.003 --> 16:54.663
Can you...

16:55.556 --> 16:59.013
Your Honor, please look at my face carefully.

16:59.351 --> 17:01.894
You may not speak until asked to do so, defendant.

17:02.646 --> 17:04.016
Do you remember me at all?

17:04.565 --> 17:06.733
Do you not even have a faint memory of me?

17:15.826 --> 17:19.662
You'll be held in contempt if you don't stop laughing!

17:22.124 --> 17:23.349
Of course not.

17:24.418 --> 17:26.294
We're total strangers.

17:27.421 --> 17:29.756
So you were a lawyer.

17:32.100 --> 17:36.170
The defendant has already admitted to all charges.

17:36.555 --> 17:38.264
We will move immediately to—

17:38.640 --> 17:40.451
Objection, Your Honor.

17:40.768 --> 17:44.844
I would like to call a critical witness to the stand.

17:45.246 --> 17:45.846
Go ahead.

17:51.570 --> 17:56.559
You will want to make allowances for his circumstances
upon learning how he ended up in his current position.

17:57.595 --> 18:01.245
He once saved a woman after she
suffered from an accident.

18:02.081 --> 18:04.588
After that, they lived together and promised
to share their futures together.

18:05.292 --> 18:07.651
But that woman had another ailment.

18:07.920 --> 18:12.506
He wanted to cure that too,
so he worked hard to save for the operation.

18:13.634 --> 18:17.004
But the woman disappeared suddenly,

18:17.554 --> 18:19.972
and his life started going wrong.

18:20.766 --> 18:22.767
Get to your point.

18:23.143 --> 18:28.231
I came here to see that patient since
he paid me for the operation.

18:29.566 --> 18:32.447
You have a period of time for which
you have no memories, do you not?

18:32.903 --> 18:35.682
That has nothing to do with this case.

18:35.948 --> 18:38.074
It very much does.

18:38.909 --> 18:42.163
The woman he saved had amnesia.

18:43.914 --> 18:47.064
There's no one who knows his true
personality better than you.

18:47.501 --> 18:50.920
That woman was you, Your Honor.

18:51.392 --> 18:52.519
I-impossible!

18:53.006 --> 18:54.423
Any further mockery will—

18:55.217 --> 18:59.144
If you study this contract, you will find your signature.

18:59.513 --> 19:01.100
This is proof.

19:03.904 --> 19:05.211
S-Silence!

19:05.597 --> 19:07.311
Court is adjourned for today.

19:12.609 --> 19:14.814
This signature is mine?

19:16.071 --> 19:19.391
I do have a period of time I can't remember.

19:20.117 --> 19:25.454
But even if you tell me that I was living
with him during that time...

19:25.812 --> 19:27.707
But that's the truth.

19:28.584 --> 19:32.837
During that time you loved that man.

19:33.964 --> 19:35.548
I sometimes have a recurring dream.

19:36.550 --> 19:38.970
A happy dream that I'm living with someone.

19:39.887 --> 19:42.867
In that dream, I'm very happy.

19:44.099 --> 19:47.643
But in reality, I don't remember a thing.

19:47.856 --> 19:51.230
What do you want me to do now?

19:52.316 --> 19:55.693
You might remember something if you have this operation.

19:59.010 --> 19:59.377
Scalpel.

20:11.037 --> 20:12.668
She's awake.

20:20.027 --> 20:21.581
A verdict has been reached.

20:21.970 --> 20:27.511
Defendant Tachibana Toru is sentenced
to 15 months in prison.

20:28.601 --> 20:32.976
There is room for allowances for the
circumstances leading to his crimes,

20:33.232 --> 20:38.697
but serving this term in atonement to all
the victims involved will be best for...

20:39.112 --> 20:41.079
Case closed.

21:00.759 --> 21:01.968
Wait, Toru.

21:04.680 --> 21:06.138
You recognize me?

21:11.478 --> 21:13.813
I remember everything.

21:14.815 --> 21:18.137
I'm sorry for what I've done to you.

21:19.861 --> 21:23.807
I even had to sentence you today.

21:27.077 --> 21:30.454
No, you were very just.

21:32.040 --> 21:34.458
Now it's my turn to wait for your return.

21:35.002 --> 21:38.671
You'll still wait for me?

21:41.675 --> 21:42.883
Of course I will.

21:43.552 --> 21:48.740
I still love you the way I did before.

21:49.016 --> 21:49.869
Sachi.

21:51.893 --> 21:53.227
I'll never let you go.

21:53.228 --> 21:54.395
We'll be together forever.

21:54.396 --> 21:55.229
Yeah.

22:02.779 --> 22:07.386
Doc, if I lose my memories, please make them come back.

22:07.659 --> 22:10.786
Three Pinoco Specials would solve that.

22:10.912 --> 22:12.455
Oh, excuse me!

22:12.456 --> 22:15.207
There's no romance in that at all!

22:15.250 --> 22:16.208
Four, then?

22:16.209 --> 22:17.126
Hey, now!

22:17.127 --> 22:17.918
Five?

22:17.919 --> 22:19.628
Stop!

22:19.629 --> 22:20.838
I'm joking.

22:24.011 --> 22:29.123
As you look at the ground uncertainly,

22:24.011 --> 22:29.123
tamerai gachi no fuseta hitomi

22:29.124 --> 22:34.420
I gently pull your hair closer to me.

22:29.124 --> 22:34.420
kono te ga sono kami hikiyoseteta

22:35.051 --> 22:41.552
You didn't speak, but only sighed,

22:35.051 --> 22:41.552
nani mo iezu ni kobore ochita tameiki

22:41.553 --> 22:46.015
and wet my chest with your tears.

22:41.553 --> 22:46.015
namida ga mune wo nurashita

22:46.016 --> 22:51.270
You longed to hear it, even if it was a lie.

22:46.016 --> 22:51.270
use demo ii... to kitto nozonde ita

22:51.271 --> 22:56.025
But I couldn't give you the answer you wanted.

22:51.271 --> 22:56.025
kimi no kimochi ni kotae kirezu

22:56.026 --> 23:04.450
If I gave you that answer, despite my cowardice,

22:56.026 --> 23:04.450
okubyou na boku ga moshi sono toki kotaetetara mada

23:04.451 --> 23:08.037
would we still be together?

23:04.451 --> 23:08.037
tsuzuiteita noka?

23:08.038 --> 23:13.334
That irregular breath my body was accustomed to,

23:08.038 --> 23:13.334
karada ga oboeta fukisoku na breath

23:13.338 --> 23:18.798
I want to feel it one more time.

23:13.338 --> 23:18.798
mou ichido subete de kanjitai

23:18.799 --> 23:24.303
The breath of surprise when I lost everything.

23:18.799 --> 23:24.303
subete wo nakushita fuyoui na breath

23:24.304 --> 23:33.479
And the pain that binds me every time I feel regret.

23:24.304 --> 23:33.479
kuyamu tabi mata sono itami ga shimetsukeru

23:45.075 --> 24:14.876
The Two Pinocos

23:45.395 --> 23:47.022
This girl is exactly like Pinoco.

23:47.142 --> 23:51.535
But the girl we met at a seaside
village had a shocking story.

23:51.635 --> 23:53.742
I want to see Pinoco-chan.

23:54.342 --> 23:55.828
The disease-causing material?

23:55.948 --> 23:57.882
This is zeta metal poisoning.

23:57.935 --> 24:00.185
When will I get better?

24:00.244 --> 24:04.744
This factory supports the village
which has no other industry.

24:04.965 --> 24:06.512
You want me to falsify the document?!

24:06.592 --> 24:07.899
This is the end for you!

24:10.108 --> 24:11.555
I won't let her die!

24:11.735 --> 24:14.635
Black Jack, Next Karte - The Two Pinocos.

24:15.901 --> 24:17.693
Karte NG...

24:19.279 --> 24:21.447
I thought it might look good on you.
